  - betting odds
  - calibration
  - benchmark
  - contamination-free evaluation
abstract: >-
  Pre-match forecasts, virtual bets, and post-match reflections from four LLM
  agents (Claude Opus 4.8, ChatGPT GPT-5.5, Gemini 3.1 Pro, Grok Expert Mode)
  on all 104 matches of the 2026 FIFA World Cup, scored against ground truth
  and real pre-match betting odds.
